{"id":"n61176-1-3","stage":1,"title":"조금 · 一点点","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61176-1-3-1","ko":"점심을 늦게 먹었다길래 밥을 많이 안 펐는데 이 정도면 될까?","zh":"听说你午饭吃得晚，所以没盛太多饭，这样够吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"점심을","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦게","meaning":"晚，迟","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64526","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹었다길래","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다길래：说明因听到某件事而采取后面的行动。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"펐는데","meaning":"盛，舀","explanation":"푸다：盛，舀；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"푸다","audio":"/audio/8607b4229ee286c7dd96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83568","senseId":"1","lemma":"푸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정도면","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될까?","meaning":"足够","explanation":"되다：足够；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"19","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"64526","definition":"比作为基准的某个时候还慢。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"8607b4229ee286c7","term":"푸다","zh":"盛，舀","audio":"/audio/8607b4229ee286c7dd96.mp3","entryId":"83568","definition":"把在里面的液体、粉、谷物等用勺子等弄到外面。","pronunciation":["푸다"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"表现事物的性质或价值好坏或多少的程度的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"足够","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"没关系，或没有问题。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/21e2fa0e4ef19e61c2c5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61176-1-3-2","ko":"너무 조금이에요. 더 주세요.","zh":"太少了。请再给我一些。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금이에요.","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f11adb62ff20afb5c851.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.859,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61176","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":41,"sequenceScore":1.8232,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说你午饭吃得晚，所以没盛太多饭，这样够吗？","太少了。请再给我一些。","搬家顺利吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说你午饭吃得晚，所以没盛太多饭，这样够吗？","太少了。请再给我一些。","搬家顺利吗？"],"answer":1}]}
